1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Hi, everyone! A quick
Diablo 3D update.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:07,660
You can now set movement keys
in first and third person.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,780
We adjusted the menu
to keep the HUD clear.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,700
We're checking these changes
during gameplay.

5
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,960
In Tristram, we're refining
proportions and colors

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,020
for a more consistent town.

7
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,340
Ogden has an animation preview

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,300
we're preparing
to add to the game.

9
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,800
We've begun testing
the Cathedral in 3D,

10
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,560
using the original map,
still outside gameplay.

11
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,580
Want to follow our progress?

12
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,680
Subscribe and join
our Discord.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,540
The support link is also
in the description.
